{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/de674bcc013139eb6be3455731642d2c.avif?t=1770646605\" width=1560 height=230 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>discord. gg\u00a0 /26RXt8EctG</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Caravanners</strong> is a chill exploration and life adventure centered around caravans and camping, set in a massive open world. Start from scratch with a small truck, buy an empty caravan, and design your dream camper. Explore nature by day, enjoy music by the campfire with friends at night. \ud83c\udfb5\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/574a90e992b6a6e04bca501357d69e00.avif?t=1770646605\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Massive open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f Diverse regions and biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 Dynamic weather system \u2013 Rain, fog, sun, snow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Play solo or co-op with 1\u20134 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Do various jobs and earn money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Detailed caravan interior and exterior customization \u2013 Create your own style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf14 Day-night cycle \u2013 Different vibes for day and night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f Caravan camping life \u2013 The world is your home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude8c Travel in convoy with your friends using multiple caravans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf A sustainable adventure awaits in a huge world without boredom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A MASSIVE OPEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big world ready to explore with swimmable lakes and seas, forests, islands, villages, towns, mountains, hidden places, and diverse regions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b92c9827b0699b3b648f979eddc8faf2.avif?t=1770646605\" width=1000 height=784 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/68df98e6b65c16bb455dcc28036968c0.poster.avif?t=1770646605\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/68df98e6b65c16bb455dcc28036968c0.webm?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/68df98e6b65c16bb455dcc28036968c0.mp4?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CARAVAN IS YOUR HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf72 Store your food in the fridge  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 Cook meals and feed yourself  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Sit on the couch, enjoy the view, play music  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9f Open or close the curtains \u2013 set your mood  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Turn the lights on or off  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udebd Use the toilet in your caravan  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26fa\ufe0f Set up your campsite with awnings around your caravan  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/778ae2498a1e611e1f0d15110215239a.poster.avif?t=1770646605\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/778ae2498a1e611e1f0d15110215239a.webm?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/778ae2498a1e611e1f0d15110215239a.mp4?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN AND BUILD YOUR OWN CAMPSITE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the campsite of your dreams from scratch, alone or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ideal camping spot with fully modular parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 Whether by a lake or deep in the woods anywhere can be your campsite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 Set up your table and chairs,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Light your campfire,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Play your music,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd69 Grill your meat,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 Chill with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True freedom awaits at your custom designed campsite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you live and what you do is entirely up to you! \ud83c\udf32\ud83d\udcab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.poster.avif?t=1770646605\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.webm?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.mp4?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, sleep, toilet, fuel, food, money, reputation points \u2013 manage both personal and general resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 DESIGN YOUR DREAM CARAVAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b42e0e2c49a52ca14fbd27accb383c6a.avif?t=1770646605\" width=600 height=194 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b8c7ac95c357e0ba4821cf25f2b8ca6c.poster.avif?t=1770646605\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b8c7ac95c357e0ba4821cf25f2b8ca6c.webm?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b8c7ac95c357e0ba4821cf25f2b8ca6c.mp4?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTERIOR CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 TUNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint choices for body, wheels, and bumpers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change bumpers,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change wheels,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your accessories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/bb67d2d8500e57275a066d11c94f3459.poster.avif?t=1770646605\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/bb67d2d8500e57275a066d11c94f3459.webm?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/bb67d2d8500e57275a066d11c94f3459.mp4?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURNITURE CUSTOMIZATION</strong> \u2013 <strong>DESIGN YOUR LIVING SPACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also customize the interior walls, floor, and ceiling of your caravan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from wood, solid colors, or fabrics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seat selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cabin selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decor selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curtain and fabric selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fridge, grill, sink, toilet...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705<strong>DON\u2019T FORGET TO ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST!\u2705</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Red Telephone Save","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1609370/ac143df491ab6cdbdccf2f9847b428bb9816e4cd.jpg"},{"name":" Yellow Waterfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1609370/5f1eb