ite of your dreams from scratch, alone or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ideal camping spot with fully modular parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 Whether by a lake or deep in the woods anywhere can be your campsite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 Set up your table and chairs,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Light your campfire,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Play your music,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd69 Grill your meat,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 Chill with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True freedom awaits at your custom designed campsite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you live and what you do is entirely up to you! \ud83c\udf32\ud83d\udcab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.poster.avif?t=1770646605\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.webm?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.mp4?t=1770646605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, sleep, toilet, fuel, food, money, reputation points \u2013 manage both personal and general resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 DESIGN YOUR DREAM CARAVAN</h